Package: posMatchR
Type: Package
Title: Annotate Single-Nucleotide RNA Sites and Build Matched Backgrounds
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Sarah", "Rennie",
    email = "sarah.rennie@bio.ku.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9731-6957")
)
Description: Provides a downstream workflow for single-nucleotide RNA site maps
    represented as GRanges objects. Sites are annotated with gene,
    transcript-region, metagene, sequence-context, and local feature-distance
    variables using user-supplied Bioconductor annotation resources. These
    annotations can be used to visualise transcript context and to construct
    matched background sets for motif, point-feature, and related enrichment
    analyses.
